3c2"],"m":133},{"id":"3drive_p6_134","t":"Hi milkeyway, these are what stand out to me on this TF.","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#134","p":6,"im":["07ed76579b914fdca990102cb54f904a698903b7"],"m":134},{"id":"3drive_p6_135","t":"DrSwing wrote: Hi milkeyway, these are what stand out to me on this TF.\n\nNow is this correct?","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#135","p":6,"im":["bcb49fcfcd95d55fb9046e38fdfb18faf1e8e7dd"],"m":135},{"id":"3drive_p6_136","t":"I would need the 3rd high above the 2nd high, and the 3rd low above the 2nd low.","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#136","p":6,"im":["187f3fbbd8f876eca313cf1c6e84509205576cf5"],"m":136},{"id":"3drive_p6_137","t":"Hi Dears, here is 6 charts I think it should be in the same concept of 3-Drive please advise me if I gone wrong","a":"MudarHM","d":"","n":"#137","p":6,"im":["198598e6990a8aba8d8481f3b5a33da9f793c8b5","55b4b32b548583ec4c5bfaf18c46407086631791","8c8c6e68a875f776430e9889257187e3bba8f326","f7d0753fe472b8e7251f861870127f1432dbee5e","1f37cc59e30ff73f3b5370d16af037070a1d4bb0","976017dae44e0e6fad6c9093699177c6d2068d9a"],"m":137},{"id":"3drive_p6_138","t":"","a":"MudarHM","d":"","n":"#138","p":6,"im":["59aae8bff9d6dfa5fbae0a3d6fc529d6ca361722","036cfa8529d60066acbe13e0b1789ae2608b9162","4aaffc7d7fde38f35ad070897ed00f7cb72bb01a"],"m":138},{"id":"3drive_p6_139","t":"your last examples look much better now Mudar you also identified the can-can","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#139","p":6,"im":[],"m":139},{"id":"3drive_p6_140","t":"Thank you Harry, Indeed I love what I learned and really this is the first time I can say \"My Eyes Open...!!\" I need your support to get the beauty of the view all,","a":"MudarHM","d":"","n":"#140","p":6,"im":[],"m":140},{"id":"3drive_p6_141","t":"hi everybody some charts with mainly 3d drive tyvm\n\ncheers AG","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#141","p":6,"im":["21511b91dcdda3cdd05adcad9b7308075fc38c65","a4f4858e45dbca5147e1bfc0f266ce01ae0ba9de","66b8f7a794313f04ec321442efb7ca1cf3b72945"],"m":141},{"id":"3drive_p6_142","t":"looking good","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#142","p":6,"im":[],"m":142},{"id":"3drive_p6_143","t":"HAVE YOU NOTICED THE 3-DRIVE / CAN-CAN ON EURUSD, WILL THIS GIVE THE EDGE? IF SO PLEASE TEACH ME HOW TO HANDLE IT (SHOULD I GO FOR IT ON 4H CHART OR ASSIGN AREA IN LTF OR JUST WAIT AND WATCH, WHICH IS A BIT DIFFICULT IN MY CASE BECAUSE I'M TRADING PART TIME)","a":"MudarHM","d":"","n":"#143","p":6,"im":["75c376e19d9b75bacd942d7620e1be5f765a08d2"],"m":143},{"id":"3drive_p6_144","t":"HI DEARS,","a":"MudarHM","d":"","n":"#144","p":6,"im":["4b764956a93055139944a229fef2aba5d41e807a"],"m":144},{"id":"3drive_p6_145","t":"Hi All\n\nA bit of a slow start to my 3D homework.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#145","p":6,"im":["2d799bbd6b72568b731b0acddc7b005d6aa551c3"],"m":145},{"id":"3drive_p6_146","t":"Ok next one\n\nChart 1 shows the Can Can as the reaction after the 3D approach\n\nChart 2 shows the Diamond as the reaction within the 3D approach","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#146","p":6,"im":["b1390df519291cb6f86c0051fb4a3f4c6f219a07","db82badeeaf084ae2e4eb6f2b7a52b338d636836"],"m":146},{"id":"3drive_p6_147","t":"Hi All\n\nOk, so when I approach my homework I do what I call reverse reading. I first look for the pattern I'm studying, once I found one I then look at the history. One day soon I'll need to do forward reading\n\nChart 1 3D pattern Here is the 3D I saw. I wasn't very happy with it as I was looking for better uniformity in the pattern.\n\nI was about to ditch it and move on when I had a look at the history and suddenly the homework exercise got a lot more interesting.\n\nChart 2 - The FO\n\nChart 3 - The QM (If we have a FO look for the QM)\n\nChart 4 - M5 and M1 showing the FO zone which price faked into\n\nChart 5 - Lets tie it all together\n\nStill don't know if it is a valid 3D?\n\nRegards In2forex","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#147","p":6,"im":["c44c76f6bc97c5d82e32e2337fc70014459d3c21","7308acd8914e99edb0070f91b77b0535e031da39","c5bf072d6441117adade0f7cc33f934ada6bf35e","a8361bd4dc225e784ec516626ee6c5ad93f49f03","bc47c282959ddcc6490bf2173ab8e14b7f004405","807700e4058decea146adf7698e235f99e5bbfab"],"m":147},{"id":"3drive_p6_148","t":"Hi All\n\nLast night I studied this chart for a long time. I just couldn't really understand the history and why it turned at that exact point. I'm still not convinced with my reasoning.\n\nChart 1 My 3D drive (Approach)\n\nChart 2 (The History) I drew 4 lines on the chart to show the history I was interested in.\n\nChart 3 (Reaction) I went back to my 3D approach to see how price reacted to these levels. I concluded that on return price Faked Out the FTR 1 to go to a lower SR flip. As price Faked Out the history level it also Faked Out the current low to form the QM level that price eventually took off from.\n\nChart 4 (putting it all together)\n\nI feel like I'm missing something on the history? Regards In2forex","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#148","p":6,"im":["bb0fe3d45f2400eb8b4da40ceabc44e4b1474c12","e037851da22b6a1f128121c6a02c4e654af78c93","0c83e7be69c162e2bf28273c5f701335bad46f61","e3fa1478788edd028c82409e2639bad9e10ce7e0"],"m":148},{"id":"3drive_p6_149","t":"3D homework","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#149","p":6,"im":["e27a876331cb704309ad860257d20d1bdda2b06b"],"m":149},{"id":"3drive_p6_150","t":"Hi All\n\nI was looking at some of the examples in this thread when I realized that some of my previous examples are not great 3D's, as price wasn't compressing. Here is an example of what I mean.\n\nIn2forex","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#150","p":6,"im":["83e4df1f6b57724e83fd83ba5f3ffcf646daffdd"],"m":150}],"images":[{"k":"80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73","t":"assets/thumbs/80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73.webp","f":"assets/images/80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73.jpeg","w":1047,"h":574,"b":63381,"o":"80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73.jpeg","p":6,"pid":"3drive_p6_126"},{"k":"3444331c76ff6dd696df00a5d058f47e20793936","t":"assets/thumbs/3444331c76ff6dd696df00a5d058f47e20793936.webp","f":